      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Login throttling: 5 failures per user per 15 min → 15 min lock, plus a per-IP limit.\nSessions: 7 days sliding, 30 days absolute; a password change logs out everywhere.\nThe CLI uses a bearer token that is accepted only on loopback.",
      "originalText": "Login throttling: 5 failures per user per 15 min → 15 min lock, plus a per-IP limit.\nSessions: 7 days sliding, 30 days absolute; a password change logs out everywhere.\nThe CLI uses a bearer token that is accepted only on loopback.",
